<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK FOREX TRADE TURNOVER FIRMS IN OCT - C.BANK.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK FOREX TRADE TURNOVER FIRMS IN OCT - C.BANK.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total foreign exchange</p>
<p>trading in Slovakia firmed to $6.94 billion in October, from</p>
<p>$6.86 billion in September, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS)</p>
<p>said on Monday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX TRADING    OCTOBER     SEPTEMBER     AUGUST</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>  overall		     6,939	 6,862	   4,993</p>
<p>  USD trading		 3,995	 4,559	   3,320</p>
<p>  DM trading		  2,564	 2,028	   1,516</p>
<p>  other currencies	    380	   275	     158</p>
<p>TRADING IN USD</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		78	   142		83</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   3,316	 3,888	   2,846</p>
<p>  at foreign banks	    601	   529	     391</p>
<p>  total			 3,995	 4,559	   3,320</p>
<p>TRADING IN DM</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		22	    31		95</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   2,153	 1,768	   1,326</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 389	   229		95</p>
<p>  total			 2,564	 2,028	   1,516</p>
<p>TRADING IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     282	   238	     113</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  98	    36		45</p>
<p>  total			   380	   275	     158</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF USD TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		13	    10		20</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,014	 1,201	     879</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 216	   199	     136</p>
<p>  total			 1,243	 1,410	   1,035</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF DM TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 5	     5		24</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,117	   985	     730</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 249	   177	     115</p>
<p>  total			 1,371	 1,167	     869</p>
<p>TOTAL  NUMBER OF TADES IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     285	   367	     197</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 103	    65		64</p>
<p>  total			   388	   432	     261</p>
<p>Note: All dollar figures are rounded off.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
